@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@token = 把登录响应中的token粘贴到这里

### 健康测试
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test

### 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 普通成员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "member",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 查看可见根目录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders?parentId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 创建子文件夹
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": 4,
  "folderName": "Java学习"
}

### 查看目录文件
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files?folderId=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新增部门（管理员）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentName": "宣传部"
}

### 新增用户（管理员）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "123456",
  "realName": "学生一",
  "role": "MEMBER",
  "departmentId": 1
}

# 上传请使用 Apifox/Postman：
# POST /api/files/upload
# multipart/form-data:
# folderId = 文件夹ID
# file = 本地文件
